 "description": "Straight avenue intersections: where two avenues (two parallel roads each) cross, an avenue ends on another, or a single road crosses or meets an avenue, sc3netmod's AVX block re-pieces the stock patch of 4-way and T tiles as one paved box: crosswalks across every arm at the box edge, curbs round the outer corners and along a closed side, and each avenue arm's median ending in a concrete nose on the cell beside the box. Box cells 20800..20804 (one per edge pattern, base 43, lanes of 43 or of T 39 where a side is closed), nose cells 20810 / 20811 (base 11204). Built by `avx.py build .` in this folder before install (art/ is made from the game's frames and is not shipped).",
